  observation: Summer No11 shop photos show green horizontal cladding and a low mono-pitched metal canopy on narrow posts, not a high arched residential portal.
  uncertainty: Door alignment remains the existing approximate bay; published map entrance is 1.32m laterally offset. No exact storefront logo/roller shutter has been invented.
